{"about_the_game":"Discover a tale of ancient enmity and hope in <strong>The Light of the Darkness: Renascence</strong>, a Metroidvania game that draws inspiration from beloved classics while embracing modern gaming advancements. Delve into the mysterious Lands of Oblivion, a cursed realm nestled between the contrasting worlds of Light and Darkness. Take on the role of the singular hybrid, a being conceived from both worlds, yet alien to both. Withstand the disdain of the Pales and the Darks as the narrative unfolds through sophisticated cutscenes, revealing a rich, original story that digs deeper than ever before.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/5e3797888ce4c83a253ea2de8fe2af94.poster.avif?t=1762894177\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/5e3797888ce4c83a253ea2de8fe2af94.webm?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/5e3797888ce4c83a253ea2de8fe2af94.mp4?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/776215dc165f44ece671c8cb37697309.webp?t=1762894177\" width=600 height=52 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sephius The Hybrid</h2>In a universe of untold fantasies, an enigmatic being awakens with no memories, trapped between the opposing realms of Light and Darkness. Fragmented visions of a luminescent world plague his mind.<br><br><br>On the brink of death, a Pale hero whispers a secret to him: they are all ensnared in this barren wasteland. The key to freedom? A wise elder and a girl whose name echoes in the stranger's visions.<br><br>With a whispered promise and memories flickering on the edge of his consciousness, he embarks on an odyssey to piece together remnants of his past and unravel the mystery that binds them to these arid lands. In his quest, not only redemption awaits him but also revelations that could alter the fate of two worlds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/db2be37ff683b201d0ac7d57c010147d.avif?t=1762894177\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/776215dc165f44ece671c8cb37697309.webp?t=1762894177\" width=600 height=52 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Caracteristics</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Metroidvania Reimagined</strong>: </li></ul>Engage in a gameplay experience that honors the Metroidvania tradition, enriched with modern 3D AAA visuals, an array of new features, and an elaborate storyline.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/b7b40711b693bb8ab3d08e385dd76be2.poster.avif?t=1762894177\" width=410 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/b7b40711b693bb8ab3d08e385dd76be2.webm?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/b7b40711b693bb8ab3d08e385dd76be2.mp4?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Essence Absorption: </li></ul>Absorb essences from other beings, allowing the player to gain strength and abilities. Discover a diverse combination of elements, natures, and personas that can be merged into a multitude of spell variants.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/6598356e6aa1e717768065cea4abc1aa.poster.avif?t=1762894177\" width=410 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/6598356e6aa1e717768065cea4abc1aa.webm?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/6598356e6aa1e717768065cea4abc1aa.mp4?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Enhanced Gameplay Mechanics</strong>:</li></ul> Revel in a host of new abilities, challenging puzzles, and epic boss battles. The gameplay elements have been finely tuned to offer a balanced blend of challenge and reward.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/9977c8e09e4646235e8cbdb3f3908a8e.poster.avif?t=1762894177\" width=410 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/9977c8e09e4646235e8cbdb3f3908a8e.webm?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/9977c8e09e4646235e8cbdb3f3908a8e.mp4?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>AAA 3D Visuals</strong>: </li></ul>Immerse yourself in a world crafted with high-fidelity graphics, realistic lighting, and a level of detail that brings the eerie Lands of Oblivion to life. Encounter beautifully detailed models and environments with a fine-tuned, intuitive interface.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/beac6993319c234c57308a1bd7a64759.poster.avif?t=1762894177\" width=410 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/beac6993319c234c57308a1bd7a64759.webm?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/beac6993319c234c57308a1bd7a64759.mp4?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Engrossing Narrative</strong>: </li></ul>Delve into a more nuanced and expansive narrative. Unravel the complex history between the Pales and the Darks, and your pivotal role as the sole hybrid destined to alter the tides of an ancient feud.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/9aeaa1525caa30c59fe4ab76adf6b41c.poster.avif?t=1762894177\" width=410 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/9aeaa1525caa30c59fe4ab76adf6b41c.webm?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/9aeaa1525caa30c59fe4ab76adf6b41c.mp4?t=1762894177\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Cinematic Cutscenes</strong>:</li></ul>Experience the unfolding narrative through polished cutscenes that add depth to the storytelling, exploring themes of identity, acceptance, and the dire need for unity.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/extras/776215dc165f44ece671c8cb37697309.webp?t=1762894177\" width=600 height=52 /></span><br><br><strong>The Light of the Darkness: Renascence</strong> extends an invitation to explore a hauntingly beautiful realm, laden with secrets, challenges, and a narrative waiting to be unraveled. The game\u2019s enhanced storytelling, coupled with sophisticated cutscenes and refined gameplay dynamics, offers a captivating journey through a world embroiled in conflict and a solemn hope for reconciliation. Add to your wishlist and brace yourself for a memorable exploration of the enigmatic Lands of Oblivion.","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1369430?t=1762894177","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1762894177","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762894177","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1369430/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762894177","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game contains violence including sword fights  and dead bodies"},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"Discover a tale of ancient enmity and hope in <strong>The Light of the Darkness: Renascence</strong>, a Metroidvania game that draws inspiration from beloved classics while embracing modern gaming advancements. Delve into the mysterious Lands of Oblivion, a cursed realm nestled between the contrasting worlds of Light and Darkness. Take on the role of the singular hybrid, a being conceived from both worlds, yet alien to both. Withstand the disdain of the Pales and the Darks as the narrative unfolds through sophisticated cutscenes, revealing a rich, original story that digs deeper than ever before.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor